          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu saa egyo yonene haliho Abafarisayo abaizire bakagambira Yesu bati, “Oruge hanu ogende, ahakuba Herode nayenda kukwita.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abashubamu ati, “Mugende mugambire emboigora egyo muti, ‘Leba, kir'eki na nyenkya ndiyo nimbinga amasitani, ninkiza n'abarwaire, ndamara eikora lyange aha kiro kya kashatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai omuli mbwenu na nyenkya na ijo ndagiirwe kukwata omuhanda nkagenda, enshonga tikyakuba, omurangi atagwire Yerusalemu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
